      "id": "code",
      "kind": "code",
      "lang": "python",
      "source": "l, r = 0, len(s) - 1\n\nwhile l < r:\n    while l < r and not s[l].isalnum(): l += 1\n    while l < r and not s[r].isalnum(): r -= 1\n    if s[l].lower() != s[r].lower():\n        return False\n    l, r = l + 1, r - 1\n\nreturn True"
    },
